      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 5_000_000\n    coupon_rate = 0.025\n    market_interest_rate = 0.03\n    years = 3\n\n    # Calculate the present value of annual interest payments and principal\n    annual_coupon = face_value * coupon_rate\n    bonds_payable = sum(\n        annual_coupon / (1 + market_interest_rate) ** year\n        for year in range(1, years + 1)\n    )\n    bonds_payable += face_value / (1 + market_interest_rate) ** years\n\n    # Return the issue-date carrying amount, rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(bonds_payable, 3)\n```",
